<section class="lk-sec2">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="lk-api" id="lk-api" data-tab="1">
      <div class="lk-apihead">
        <h2 class="lk-apih2">Get all of this and more through the API. <span>Every lookup on this page is one function call, with the S&amp;P 500, the Dow Jones and the additions and removals behind each list.</span></h2>
        <div class="lk-acts"><a class="lk-cta" href="/pricing">See plans</a><a class="lk-cta lk-cta-out" href="/docs/index-membership">Read the index membership docs</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lk-apivis" aria-hidden="true">
        <!-- A static frame of the animation (lookup.js runs it). Real rows: see lookup.js for where they come from. -->
        <div class="lk-win lk-apires lk-ares" id="lk-ares">
          <div class="lk-abar"><span class="lk-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="lk-url">api.xfinlink.com/v1/index/<span id="lk-aurl">ndx100</span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="lk-ain">
            <div class="lk-tabs" id="lk-atabs"><span>S&amp;P 500</span><span class="lk-cur">Nasdaq-100</span><span>Dow Jones</span></div>
            <div class="lk-ahead"><span id="lk-ahead">Nasdaq-100 · 10/03/2000</span><span class="lk-acount"><span id="lk-acount">100</span> members</span></div>
            <div class="lk-agrid lk-agh"><span>Ticker</span><span>Company</span><span class="lk-aj">Joined</span><span>Left</span></div>
            <div id="lk-arows"><div class="lk-agrid lk-arow"><span>AMZN</span><span>AMAZON COM INC</span><span class="lk-aj">1998-12-21</span><span></span></div><div class="lk-agrid lk-arow"><span>EBAY</span><span>EBAY INC</span><span class="lk-aj">1999-10-06</span><span>2023</span></div><div class="lk-agrid lk-arow"><span>PSFT</span><span>PEOPLESOFT INC</span><span class="lk-aj">1995-12-18</span><span>2004</span></div><div class="lk-agrid lk-arow"><span>SBUX</span><span>STARBUCKS CORP</span><span class="lk-aj">1996-11-25</span><span></span></div></div>
            <div class="lk-amore">+ <span id="lk-amore">96</span> more</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lk-win lk-apiq" id="lk-aq">
          <div class="lk-aq"><span class="lk-alabel">Query</span><pre>xfl.<span class="f">index</span>(
    <span class="s">"<span id="lk-aix">ndx100</span>"</span>,
    as_of=<span class="s">"<span class="lk-adate" id="lk-adate">2000-03-10</span><span class="lk-caret"></span>"</span>)</pre></div>
        </div>
        <div class="lk-win lk-apialso">
          <span class="lk-alabel">Also in the API</span>
          <span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="7" fill="#e8f2fa"/><path d="M4.2 7.2 6 9l3.8-4" stroke="#0872b0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>S&amp;P 500 and Dow Jones</span>
          <span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="7" fill="#e8f2fa"/><path d="M4.2 7.2 6 9l3.8-4" stroke="#0872b0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Additions and removals by date</span>
          <span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="7" fill="#e8f2fa"/><path d="M4.2 7.2 6 9l3.8-4" stroke="#0872b0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Any date back to 1995</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="lk-about">
      <h2>About this lookup</h2>
      <div class="lk-acc">
        <details><summary>What each lookup shows<svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 1.5v9M1.5 6h9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></summary><div class="lk-acc-b"><p>A lookup lists the members of the Nasdaq-100 on the date you pick, with the company's name, its ticker, the day it joined the index and whether it is still in the index today. Companies that later left the index are included, whether they were acquired, merged, delisted or replaced.</p></div></details>
        <details><summary>Dates covered<svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 1.5v9M1.5 6h9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></summary><div class="lk-acc-b"><p>Any date from 1 January 1995 up to the present day can be looked up. Companies already in the index on that first date show their join date as 1995 or earlier. Weekends and holidays work too and return the list in force on that day.</p></div></details>
        <details><summary>Questions it answers<svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 1.5v9M1.5 6h9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></summary><div class="lk-acc-b"><ul>
          <li>When did Tesla join the Nasdaq-100?</li>
          <li>Which companies were in the Nasdaq-100 during the 2008 financial crisis?</li>
          <li>What did the Nasdaq-100 look like on the first day of a backtest?</li>
          <li>When did Oracle leave the Nasdaq-100?</li>
        </ul></div></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
